{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combine. Split. Promote.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>regular chess moves to merge two pieces</strong> onto the same square, creating a powerful hybrid. <strong>Move the combined piece using either piece\u2019s abilities</strong>, or<strong> split them apart</strong> later to individual pieces for strategic positioning when the time is right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware, if the <strong>combined piece is captured, you'll lose both</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/chessplus_pieces.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Explore exponentially more strategies</strong> by combine pieces into powerful hybrids or split them later for strategic positioning. <strong>Need more queens? Create your own</strong> with a &quot;Biook&quot; (Bishop + Rook) or rocket a pawn across the board with the &quot;Rawn&quot; (Rook + Pawn) for a quick promotion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Balanced Chess at its core</strong>, only regular legal moves apply. But be careful if your combined piece is captured - you'll lose them both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654 Show off your ELO ranking in PC / Mobile in <strong>cross-platform multiplayer</strong>\u00a0and make every move matter in a <strong>Roguelike adventure.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Use traditional Chess moves to combine your pieces.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/combine_speed.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Combined pieces can move as either piece or even together.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/split_speed.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Unlock new strategies by splitting your pieces into their original forms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/split_promote_speed.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The <strong>officially</strong> <strong>licensed</strong> digital version of the Chessplus board game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This digital version of our Chessplus board game is a crafted with passion from our small team. Please reach out with thoughts, ideas and criticisms - we want to hear your feedback!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273750?t=1744117375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/7d4c9088c11c17ad95a011145245cb2de44b18fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744117375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/fc13f4538ec3d0f3387058a6460ec194736139b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744117375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/fc13f4538ec3d0f3387058a6460ec194736139b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744117375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combine. Split. Promote.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>regular chess moves to merge two pieces</strong> onto the same square, creating a powerful hybrid. <strong>Move the combined piece using either piece\u2019s abilities</strong>, or<strong> split them apart</strong> later to individual pieces for strategic positioning when the time is right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware, if the <strong>combined piece is captured, you'll lose both</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/chessplus_pieces.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Explore exponentially more strategies</strong> by combine pieces into powerful hybrids or split them later for strategic positioning. <strong>Need more queens? Create your own</strong> with a &quot;Biook&quot; (Bishop + Rook) or rocket a pawn across the board with the &quot;Rawn&quot; (Rook + Pawn) for a quick promotion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Balanced Chess at its core</strong>, only regular legal moves apply. But be careful if your combined piece is captured - you'll lose them both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654 Show off your ELO ranking in PC / Mobile in <strong>cross-platform multiplayer</strong>\u00a0and make every move matter in a <strong>Roguelike adventure.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Use traditional Chess moves to combine your pieces.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/combine_speed.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Combined pieces can move as either piece or even together.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/split_speed.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2654\u00a0<strong>Unlock new strategies by splitting your pieces into their original forms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/split_promote_speed.gif?t=1744117375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The <strong>officially</strong> <strong>licensed</strong> digital version of the Chessplus board game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This digital version of our Chessplus board game is a crafted with passion from our small team. Please reach out with thoughts, ideas and criticisms - we want to hear your feedback!</p>","developers":["Chessplus Pty Ltd","Josh Caratelli"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/ceec20f977b32b425bea304b50e6c17000b7cc34/header.jpg?t=1744117375","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116267,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116267/movie480.mp4?t=1743998155","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116267/movie_max.mp4?t=1743998155"},"name":"Chessplus Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116267/a009951f73faa3745dabc095b758996eed3f881b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743998155","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116